/button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" class="min-h-11 shrink-0 rounded-full border px-3 text-sm border-line text-muted">训练安排</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" class="min-h-11 shrink-0 rounded-full border px-3 text-sm border-line text-muted">动作与热身</button></div><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 text-xs text-muted"><span role="status" aria-live="polite">共 61 篇知识</span></div><div id="fk-learning-results" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="fk-reader-reading" tabindex="0" class="space-y-2"><details name="fk-learning-article" data-knowledge-id="EDU001" class="fk-learning-article home-card min-w-0 p-4"><summary class="min-h-11 cursor-pointer list-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex items-start justify-between gap-2 font-semibold"><span class="min-w-0 flex-1 break-words">加速、跑得快、维持速度，有什么区别？</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down fk-learning-chevron shrink-0 text-muted" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></span><span class="fk-reader-conclusion mt-2 block text-sm font-normal text-muted">起速快、最高速度快、后程稳，是三个不同目标。</span></summary><div class="fk-learning-reading mt-3 space-y-3 border-t border-line pt-3 text-sm"><ul class="fk-reader-points" data-testid="reading-points"><li>加速：从慢到快</li><li>最高速度：能跑到多快</li><li>速度耐力：能把高速保持多久</li></ul><div class="fk-reader-practice"><h3>平时怎么用</h3><p>记下每段用时、休息时间和后几组的动作变化。</p></div><p class="keep text-xs leading-relaxed text-muted" data-testid="reading-note">一次短跑成绩，不能说明所有能力。</p><details class="fk-learning-sources border-t border-line"><summary class="min-h-11 cursor-pointer content-center text-xs text-muted">详细说明与来源</summary><div class="space-y-3 pb-3 text-xs leading-relaxed"><p>加速关注从低速提升速度的过程；最高速度关注快速跑姿与动作质量；速度耐力关注高速状态的持续或重复能力。训练距离、速度、组间恢复与总量应服务于明确目标。</p><p>适用范围：短距离计时不能单独判断哪种